abstract: >-
  A reusable, source-agnostic data model for life cycle inventory product systems.
  It represents activities, flows, flow objects, reference flows, lifecycle stages,
  locations, classifications, source records, and quantitative exchange data for
  products, materials, components, and assemblies.
